-    d.  Combine gradient components into steepest descent image $J(r)$ [S1, unofficial].
-    e.  Update pose using SGD step: $\pi_c \leftarrow \pi_c + \alpha (J(r) \cdot \Delta I(r))$ [S1, unofficial].
